{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2023-03-07 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY TO PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT BOFA SECURITIES 2023 CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE: CPB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARK CLOUSE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND CARRIE ANDERSON, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BOFA SECURITIES 2023 CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MARCH 14, 2023 AT 1:00 P.M. EST. THE DISCUSSION WILL BE AVAILABLE VIA A LISTEN-ONLY LIVE WEBCAST ACCESSIBLE AT HTTPS://BOFA.VERACAST.COM/WEBCASTS/BOFA/CONSUMERRETAIL2023/ID3P2E13.'}